.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt STRALLOC_CATXLONG 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm stralloc_catxlong
.Nd append an unsigned long integer in hexadecimal format to a stralloc
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In stralloc.h
.Ft size_t
.Fn stralloc_catxlong "stralloc *sa" "unsigned long u"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn stralloc_catxlong
function formats the unsigned long integer
.Fa u
as a hexadecimal string and appends it to the dynamic string
.Fa sa .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 1 on success, or 0 on memory allocation failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr stralloc_catlong 3